Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:14.14,Toho,,0,0,0,,{\fnKozuka Gothic Pro B\fs48\pos(400,255)}Toho International Corporation Production
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.83,0:00:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-Nice car, isn't it?\N -Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.50,0:00:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's MY car!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.47,0:00:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Th-thief!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!! Ahhhhh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.14,0:00:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you. Hey, wait up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Produced by: Yutaka Fujioka, Shunji Oki\NPlanned by: Fujio Akazuka, Chika Nakayama
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:00:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Original concept. Monkey Punch (Manga\NAction Comics) Script. Hiroshi Nagano{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.12,0:01:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Filmed by: Kenmuro Shigen Designer: Kazuo Takenaka Lighting:\NShoshichi Kojima Sound: Noboru Nishio Music: Masaru Satohn
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.29,0:01:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant Director: Koyu Shimura Coloring: Hakuto Taben Special effects: Jin Nakano\NEditing: Sachiko Yamaji Still pictures: Koh Nakao Assistant Producer: Yo no ho Koh
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.43,0:01:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Equipment:. Biken Promotions Sets: Toho Design Wardrobe: Kyoto Costuming Hair\Nand makeup: Katsura Kawaguchi Film developing: Toyo Developing Sound: Tokyo Eiga{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.94,0:01:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cast
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuki Meguro
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hideko Ezaki, Shiro Itoh, Kunie Tanaka
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Akira Hitomi, Takashi Ezaki,\NRinichi Yamamoto, Arihiro Fujimura
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.62,0:01:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Maria Anzai, Megumi, Rena Natsuki, Poppies
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.45,0:01:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiyoshi Maekawa, Akira Oizumi,\NEisei Amamoto, E. H. Eric
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.96,0:01:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sachio Sakai, Toki Shiozawa, Kokki Ishiyama,\NJunichi Tanaka, Minoru Uezu, Sozo Fukuyama
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji Kojima, Katsuo Umino, Kyuji Aozora, Koji\NAozora Stunts: Uni Kizoh, Voice: Obei Toru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.30,0:01:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Kunie Tanaka
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.80,0:01:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Directed by: Takashi Tsuboshima
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.25,0:02:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, take a look at this. Horrible, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.09,0:02:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But I guess a fruitcake's\Ngotta forgive another fruitcake.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's no way to act after appealing to a man's sex\Ndrive. Now I'll have a hard time getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.10,0:02:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.84,0:02:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But my, you're a cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:02:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuck? How rude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.14,0:03:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,H-hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.38,0:03:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Just shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.92,0:03:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Heyyy, wait up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.20,0:03:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrrgh, that damn asshole. I'll get my revenge!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.43,0:03:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.84,0:03:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Loooook, a beautiful naked woman is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Beautiful?! Naked?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.74,0:03:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kaaaay, where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,She's very close by! Turn the corner\Nand it's the third building. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.28,0:03:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.41,0:03:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'll go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.92,0:03:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, me. I was here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.09,0:03:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not so fast. I'M first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.19,0:03:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Niiiiice.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.96,0:04:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Merci.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.96,0:04:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sweetie!\NWanna go on a date with me tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.44,0:04:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a very straightforward way to put it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.91,0:04:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it was. After all, I've been\Nwaiting since the day I was born to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where I'm being taken right how?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.78,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm serious here.\NI promise I'll go on a date with you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.79,0:04:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to my psychokinesis.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.86,0:04:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be expecting you tonight, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.79,0:04:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.34,0:05:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Seal it with a kiss!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.71,0:05:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? My dream came true?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Awwww, come onnnn, someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.56,0:05:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't take it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.71,0:05:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin the Third\NStrange Psychokinetic Strategy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.42,0:06:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Security breach! Security breach!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.44,0:06:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Security breach!!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.21,0:07:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, owww.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.20,0:07:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.40,0:07:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.91,0:07:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw man... it's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, where the hell did he run off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.81,0:08:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he. Idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.14,0:08:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, Mademoiselle, you have nothing more\Nto fear. For at your side, you have a strong...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.12,0:08:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.32,0:08:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, me? I'm Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.95,0:08:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunpen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Not "Lunpen”, Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.76,0:08:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,LUPIN. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.96,0:08:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.73,0:08:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.26,0:08:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, you rescued me without knowing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.27,0:08:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup. It was love at first sight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.90,0:08:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You have interesting taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.31,0:08:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Love comes at ya\Nunexpectedly sometimes. I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You SHOULD thank me.\NOtherwise I won't cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.11,0:09:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight, Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.85,0:09:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,\Nif you underestimate me, you'll get in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.26,0:09:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let looks deceive you, I am the seventh Zenigata\Ndescended from the famous Edo Hunter Heiji Zenigata.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.37,0:09:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I make even cranky kids shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.77,0:09:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't forget, I'm on his staff, and I\Ndescended from Echizen Ohka, making...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.71,0:09:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast. I descended from\NKinshiro Touyama, and I'm also...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.11,0:09:48.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!I No one cares about you two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.25,0:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch! Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, where'd you put Mine Fujiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she escape to?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.39,0:09:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We know you let her escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mine Fujiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pretty name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:05.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.90,0:10:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop joking around, ya jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop joking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.40,0:10:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.80,0:10:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,\Nwe know full well that you let Fujiko escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't the fact that you're wearing\Nwomen's prison clothing enough?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.08,0:10:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.92,0:10:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent last night gazing up at\Nthe starry sky as I went on a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.09,0:10:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.\NAnd then, my head was suddenly smacked,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.13,0:10:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,stars came out of my eyes,\Nand when I came to, here I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.96,0:10:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrrgh, you jackass. You amuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.53,0:10:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well. In that case,\NI'll give you some extensive proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.40,0:10:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, last night, many guards saw your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.74,0:10:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We're interrogating them on the\Nother side of the glass as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.65,0:10:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.55,0:10:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he, how do you like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.42,0:10:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:10:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:00.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you scared now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.32,0:11:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Owwiw I
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm sorry to inform you that our withesses say the action\Nwas too fast to catch the face of the criminal. That is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.73,0:11:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.67,0:11:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.07,0:11:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he he. So sorry about that, Mr. Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.37,0:11:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,This is getting to my head so\Nbad it's giving me a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.24,0:11:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough. Ow, my nose hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Lupin, you say??
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Qui.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.12,0:11:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.19,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know of the\Nphantom thief Arséne Lupin?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.63,0:11:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course! He was a brave man\Nof our mighty present-day France.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.20,0:11:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,But... a poor, lost thief.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.71,0:11:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.81,0:11:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.64,0:11:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then do you know of his son, Arséne Lupin |17
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.01,0:12:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.55,0:12:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I shall explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.19,0:12:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin the 1st loved solitude. So while the first\NLupin was a sort of crafty artist who worked alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.03,0:12:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,his son was a genius\Nat creating crime organizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.20,0:12:22.14,Default,,0,0,0,,After he followed his father's footsteps, he united\Nthe world's organized crime units in a heartbeat,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,built 311 secret bases, and had\N86,313 followers under the Lupin Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.91,0:12:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, that's impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Er, I mean, how frightening. Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.42,0:12:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.89,0:12:45.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, one day, Lupin the 2nd\Nwas betrayed by his 86,313th recruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.10,0:12:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,which caused the Lupin Empire\Nto be crushed by the Maccherone family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.13,0:12:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm Mm mm,\NThose Maccherone bastards!... How horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.87,0:12:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.48,0:13:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him. He's the sole living member\Nof the Lupin Empire, Daisuke Jigen.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.62,0:13:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Qui.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.02,0:13:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But... I wasn't the only survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.16,0:13:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,So, who else survived then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.73,0:13:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The year was 1974!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.90,0:13:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,March 5th, at 8 AM!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.17,0:13:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Qui, oui.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.24,0:13:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In a small tea house\Nin Damascus, the capital of Syria.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.11,0:13:34.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't quite follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,A certain organization ordered a certain bored and nearby man to\Nlook at a certain magazine shoot, and made a certain discovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.22,0:13:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Certain, certain, what kind of certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.19,0:13:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Certainly here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a shot of the magazine shoot he saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.83,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.06,0:13:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,By magnifying this portion of the picture by 100.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And then another 100 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.64,0:14:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.41,0:14:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, if you zoom in another 10 times.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.85,0:14:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Qui! Oui, oui, oui, OUI!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You know this man, don't you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm mm mm mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.25,0:14:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle. A miracle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.06,0:14:31.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This boy is the one survivor of the massacre,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and the one true heir\Nto the Lupin Empire. He is Lupin the Third!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.74,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at his chest. The tattoo that Lupin the 2nd placed\Non all of his children is all the proof you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.25,0:14:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My, I've never seen\Nsomething this fascinating before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.85,0:14:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That is exactly why\NI came to see you about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.45,0:14:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he was raised here in my orphanage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:15:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, we called him "Lupin”, but we\Ndidn't realize he was really a Frenchman.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.63,0:15:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Probably because of his mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.73,0:15:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.67,0:15:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,His mother was Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.77,0:15:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to being a\Ngenius at creating organizations,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.18,0:15:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,he was also a genius at creating children.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.21,0:15:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see. I see.\NOh, I suddenly remember something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.69,0:15:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is everything about his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.92,0:15:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, age O.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:39.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad boy, Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.33,0:15:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, age 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.34,0:15:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad boy, Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.15,0:15:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, age 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.15,0:16:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad boy, Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.16,0:16:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, age 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.07,0:16:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad boy, Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.34,0:16:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, age 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.35,0:16:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad boy, Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still hear it, the sound of my voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.22,0:16:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Teaching Lupin of the harshness of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I was hoping he would return\Nto us a shining star of Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.70,0:16:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but ever since then, he's been missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.67,0:16:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, thanks for all the stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Merci, Mum Pére Monkey face.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.81,0:16:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Non, Mokkinpart!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.05,0:17:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, adieu, Mum Pére Mokkinpart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.79,0:17:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey now, you should knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.67,0:17:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,At last I found you, Daisuke Jigen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.70,0:17:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did the Mob send you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.97,0:17:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.68,0:17:34.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What a convenient circumstance. Right\Nafter I kill you, a priest can pray for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.18,0:17:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he can pray for YOU.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.89,0:17:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shitl... Adieu.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.06,0:17:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,0.8 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.01,0:18:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, I drew blood again.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.36,0:18:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Pray for these bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.71,0:18:36.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.91,0:18:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,New autumn fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.94,0:19:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.88,0:19:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That face?...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.69,0:19:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,My wallet!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Freeze.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.97,0:19:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Stick 'em up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.30,0:19:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm gonna\Ngive it back, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.07,0:19:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but I'm not that cheap a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.98,0:19:46.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I stopped you because I think\Nyou're the one I've been looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.35,0:19:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.08,0:19:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.53,0:20:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph. You're pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.07,0:20:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaddaya think?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.48,0:20:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,How many guns do you have??
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.58,0:20:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.69,0:20:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.63,0:20:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.33,0:20:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But are you by any\Nchance Arséne Lupin the Third?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.57,0:20:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.44,0:20:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,To think this man is Lupin the Third. Jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! How dare you use\Nthat language in my presence!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.34,0:20:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't mean you,\NI was talking about Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.85,0:20:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No doubt, he is Arséne Lupin. It's in this file.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.72,0:21:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, hmm, oh, oui, oui, wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.09,0:21:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.86,0:21:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,-Can you read that? -Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.36,0:21:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Moron! You read it like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Pseudo French"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.90,0:21:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,QOui, Madame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.64,0:21:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a Madame!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.51,0:21:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Zenigata.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.11,0:21:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.31,0:21:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I order you here and now to\Ninvestigate Arséne Lupin the Third.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.85,0:21:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I will arrest him immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.31,0:21:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't ask you to arrest him, not\Nunless we find reasonable evidence to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.39,0:21:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow I will arrest him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, do whatever you want! You imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.73,0:21:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We understand, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.26,0:21:43.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Promise me you will capture Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.43,0:21:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If you fail, you will both be...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.64,0:21:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, what are you farting around for?\NLook for him! Now's no time to eat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.45,0:22:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, what laziness I have to put up with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.15,0:22:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We found him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too quick! So, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.96,0:22:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.89,0:22:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where abouts?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.39,0:22:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ummm, around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.91,0:22:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,How horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.28,0:22:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that the heir to the Lupin Empire...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:35.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is living in such filth.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.49,0:22:40.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, how pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.75,0:22:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like this's the only place I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.96,0:22:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But please explain to me, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.66,0:22:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'd cut the Master-crap if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We're equals now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.30,0:22:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and call me Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:23:00.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, Lupin, why are you living like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.74,0:23:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I think of Tokyo, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.61,0:23:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I think of all of Japan,\Nfor that matter, as my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.29,0:23:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So some days I feel like\Nstaying in first class hotels or condos,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.09,0:23:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but other days\NI feel like sleeping under the stars.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.33,0:23:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I suppose that is nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.10,0:23:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess ya don't believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.73,0:23:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, then we'll go to a nicer place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.87,0:23:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.20,0:23:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The Residence Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.77,0:23:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Residence Hall?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.31,0:23:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. It's a place that was\Nbuilt from a hefty sum of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.25,0:23:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Ponpydo can't make his reservation, and no one's going\Nto take his place, so I figured we'd go check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.35,0:23:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.89,0:23:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrrrgh,\Nlooks like the rats have come out of hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuradamon's rats, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.23,0:24:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing, he's had a lot of brain trauma.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.34,0:24:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Swarm!!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.44,0:24:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, run for it! I'll handle things here!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.34,0:24:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I have business with Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.78,0:24:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, what do you mean business?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.51,0:24:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.85,0:24:14.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, YOU'RE in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.95,0:24:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,No, YOU are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.12,0:24:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, just who do you think I am?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.58,0:24:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.62,0:24:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That way! That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.82,0:24:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This way! This way!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.06,0:24:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Lupin's sole subordinate, Daisuke Jigen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.57,0:24:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.37,0:24:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.74,0:24:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.87,0:24:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.64,0:24:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,There he isl!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.68,0:24:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.05,0:24:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Shit!\NThis is the first time the Law has ignored me.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.58,0:24:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn arrogant jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.15,0:24:53.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.29,0:24:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.16,0:25:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what're you doing there? Why am I on top?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.06,0:25:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.26,0:25:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Inspector, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.27,0:25:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-Here, have a shoe. -Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.37,0:25:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You look splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's no time\Nto be doing this, Lupin's getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.88,0:25:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.65,0:26:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.39,0:26:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.96,0:26:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it! Full speed ahead...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.93,0:26:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And break suddenly at the right curve!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouuuch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.27,0:26:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's overheated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.18,0:26:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that.\NDamn, Lupin is getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.78,0:26:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a nice trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.85,0:26:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhh, here he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.89,0:26:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.47,0:26:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't you understand what "stop" means?!\NHey, come this way, dammit! How frustrating!!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.81,0:26:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Up yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.48,0:27:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you speak to me that way, Lupin!\NMmmm, I'll try my psychokinesis on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.25,0:27:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh! I can't swim! Help me, Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.24,0:27:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That Lupin,\NI wonder where he disappeared off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.40,0:27:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo. Took ya long enough, Jigen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.67,0:27:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that you, Lupin?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.14,0:28:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.11,0:28:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.38,0:28:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.12,0:28:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,This room was borrowed and set aside for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.02,0:28:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and that's why I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.12,0:28:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But no one told you, so how did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.66,0:28:19.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.39,0:28:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.60,0:28:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to the furniture?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.10,0:28:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What furniture?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.07,0:28:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play innocent. There was a\Nbed, chairs, table, TV and a refrigerator.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.44,0:28:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh,\Nthose were in the way, so I gave them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.68,0:28:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Gave them away?? Who'd you give them to?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.65,0:28:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,An outstanding Japanese citizen.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.03,0:28:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this would...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.37,0:29:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Be uncomfortable for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.21,0:29:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.69,0:29:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.52,0:29:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Under that bed, I hid a 30 billion\Nyen deposit note from a Swiss bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.03,0:29:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the net fortune of the Lupin Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.03,0:29:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Means nothing to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.23,0:29:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Means nothing??
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.84,0:29:44.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, do you have any idea what I went\Nthrough for you? What sweat and tears I...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.32,0:29:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I was wrong about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.26,0:30:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father and grandfather must\Nbe turning in their graves right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.57,0:30:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess this shatters any chance\Nof the Lupin Empire's restoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.78,0:30:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I think a Democracy is\Nbetter than an Empire, personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.15,0:30:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.55,0:30:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.45,0:30:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, ahhh! That's Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.86,0:30:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.13,0:30:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You could've just used the stairs,\NSir. You're pretty spry, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.10,0:30:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.91,0:30:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.41,0:30:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, just observing the goings on of our world.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.48,0:30:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Jigen, being alive sure is fun, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.52,0:31:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We eat when we're\Nhungry, sleep when we're sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.42,0:31:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And fall in love when we want to\Nfall in love. What else do ya need?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.93,0:31:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but Son.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.87,0:31:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.48,0:31:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.35,0:31:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.06,0:31:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter when I see you,\Nyou always have a strange look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.93,0:31:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,If it bothers you, I'll become normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.54,0:31:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.31,0:31:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,God is the Lord of normality.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.61,0:31:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll agree to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.13,0:32:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Fujiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.97,0:32:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I want diamonds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.24,0:32:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I also want emeralds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.01,0:32:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.24,0:32:34.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I also want opals and sapphires and rubies.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.82,0:32:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish. As you wish. As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.46,0:32:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.56,0:32:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's directions to the Trade Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.66,0:32:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Trade Department?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.33,0:32:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're trading jewels\Nfrom all over the world there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.30,0:32:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,By today's value,\Nyou should get 560 billion yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.97,0:33:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,560 billion?!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.34,0:33:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And you want me to get that for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.51,0:33:06.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.01,0:33:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin takes orders from no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.38,0:33:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.62,0:33:15.75,Default,,0,0,0,,He does take requests sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.86,0:33:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, pleeeease?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.09,0:33:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I accept. But before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.70,0:33:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.62,0:33:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ummm. An eye for an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.62,0:33:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin never falls for the same\Ntrick twice. Now, this time for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.43,0:33:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.77,0:34:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the job done tonight. Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.94,0:34:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's no way to treat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.94,0:34:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,H-hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.12,0:34:16.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.45,0:34:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell'm I supposed to get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.92,0:34:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming, he's coming. Close to Sherlock\NHolmes's tail, a second runner has approached.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.40,0:34:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Which contender is he? The thing shining on his chest\Nappears to be an "L", and he is running at an amazing speed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.57,0:34:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The space between him and\NHolmes is a mere 10 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.47,0:34:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"I pursues, Holmes retreats. "L\Nstill pursues, well, what's happened?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.61,0:34:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they even? They're even! Holmes,\Nhang in there! Oh, "L" has passed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.11,0:34:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"L" has won. "L" has just\Nbroken through the white tape.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.08,0:34:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I-it's Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.32,0:34:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that, hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.56,0:34:58.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you answer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.43,0:35:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.00,0:35:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you asleep? Hey, wake up!!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.58,0:35:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm, you jackass!!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.96,0:35:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes? Phone for you, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.02,0:35:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.76,0:35:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a young woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.33,0:35:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! Why didn't you say so? What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.86,0:35:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. Sorry to keep you waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.10,0:35:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.77,0:35:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, this is Zenigata.\NWhat? You're Mine Fujiko?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.02,0:35:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All's well.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.69,0:36:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,All's well here, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.09,0:36:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How are you going to get in? There\Nare guards on the inside and outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.53,0:36:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin's dictionary\Ndoesn't have "impossible" in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.70,0:36:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What a carefree spirit. But could\Nyou please let me down already?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.23,0:36:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't get enough of this excitement.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.00,0:36:16.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Mm Mm mm, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.27,0:36:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.84,0:36:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, are you okay? Lupin!!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.81,0:36:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.88,0:36:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.59,0:36:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, gimme a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.39,0:36:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.43,0:36:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not enough, gimme a LIGHT.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.67,0:36:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Owww.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.64,0:36:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.41,0:36:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.81,0:36:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk back, go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.24,0:36:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.62,0:37:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that? Looks young.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.32,0:37:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.15,0:37:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.39,0:37:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.42,0:37:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we should match for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.99,0:37:14.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Rock, paper, scissors, match! Since I\Nlost, I'm going. Shall I hold it for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.89,0:37:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Woof, woof, meowww.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.22,0:37:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.76,0:37:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're a special patrol unit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.99,0:37:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, what exactly is your business here?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.16,0:37:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.77,0:37:57.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.72,0:38:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.59,0:38:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The emergency bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.93,0:38:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like anything is amiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.99,0:38:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.13,0:38:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,'Sirl
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.77,0:39:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.12,0:39:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.94,0:39:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.73,0:40:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Ohhh, pachinko!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.03,0:40:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Jigen should be here any minute. Come, hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.30,0:40:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Nnngh, I can't move. Stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.30,0:40:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.19,0:41:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.03,0:41:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.50,0:41:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.54,0:41:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right on schedule. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.78,0:42:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still more.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.48,0:42:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.92,0:42:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a large safe behind that clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.65,0:42:08.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.76,0:42:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.56,0:42:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The real expensive stuff is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.03,0:42:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Women sure are greedy creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.46,0:42:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.17,0:42:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't patronize me.\NMy dictionary doesn't have a word for...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.87,0:42:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A word for "impossible,"\Nright? Pleeeeease, open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.68,0:42:30.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.91,0:42:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.34,0:43:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, you've opened it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.88,0:43:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It was nothing.\NLupin's psychokinetic powers are king.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.29,0:43:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lupin! Get him!!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.03,0:43:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He's over there. Grab him!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.57,0:43:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.07,0:43:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that way!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.01,0:43:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid, stupid, stupid! How dare\Nthey leave me behind! Dammit!! Police!!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.52,0:43:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lupin. Ah, he's over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.80,0:44:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull on it! Umph.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.64,0:44:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull on it, Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.69,0:44:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.20,0:44:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Goll
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.53,0:44:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch him...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.04,0:44:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Owww.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.08,0:44:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't imitate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.38,0:44:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrrgh, what're you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.92,0:44:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.60,0:45:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Adieu.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.83,0:45:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrrgh, I've got a headache.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.70,0:45:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up, he's coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.94,0:45:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Zenigata, spank, spank.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.11,0:45:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit! How dare he patronize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.21,0:45:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.58,0:45:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Increase speed!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.48,0:45:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My! Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.19,0:46:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I am a bachelor. Ahhh, ack!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.06,0:46:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The wheel.. the wheel...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.86,0:46:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, pull yourself together.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.20,0:46:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When you turn, you'll crash!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.90,0:46:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.64,0:46:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin got away AGAIN...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.88,0:47:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.86,0:47:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, I don't know whose car that was.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.37,0:47:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the number?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.47,0:47:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have time to memorize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.00,0:47:28.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin Potato,\Nthird-rate, klutz, lazy-ass, yo' mamal!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.38,0:47:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.02,0:47:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come sniff it out.\NSmell, smell, and smell some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.52,0:47:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What are we smelling for?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.66,0:47:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it obvious?\NThe least smelly car is the fishiest!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.56,0:47:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhh, smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.53,0:47:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you standing around for? Gol!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.63,0:47:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots. Stop standing still like pieces of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.40,0:47:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys really ARE stupid.\NIdiots. Stop standing still like pieces of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.20,0:47:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Those guys really ARE stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.07,0:48:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Elusive Thief Lupin has arrived in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.71,0:48:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin the Third was still alive!!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.68,0:48:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Naturally so. He sneaked out of the jewel shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.82,0:48:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Zenigata and his officers are presently in\Nhot pursuit of the one who stole the jewels,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.86,0:48:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,but they have no leads as of now and it looks like\Nthe investigation will take longer than anticipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.87,0:48:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Lupin, since they can't find the jewels,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.20,0:48:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean\Nsomeone else got them before we did?...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.37,0:48:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.94,0:48:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeahhh, I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.61,0:48:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.32,0:48:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The only person that makes\Nsense from all of this is Fujiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.03,0:48:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She must have betrayed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.66,0:49:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No! My Fujiko is not that kind of woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.43,0:49:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.37,0:49:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just blinded by your love for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.94,0:49:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No! My Fujiko is not that kind of woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.81,0:49:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the\N"Fujiko, Fujiko?" I'm Yamako Asama!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.08,0:49:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Mount Asama
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.57,0:49:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Buon giorho, Buon giorno. Good morning.\NGood morning, brothers of the Black Streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.44,0:49:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're already aware of this, but a\Nvery powerful enemy of ours, the Lupin Empire,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.28,0:49:57.19,Default,,0,0,0,,still has a living blood-heir who has returned to\NJapan. His name is apparently "Lupin the Third".
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.39,0:50:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,He is a young man with all the skills and intellect\Nof his grandfather, and if we leave him alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.83,0:50:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,he will someday grow to be a threat to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.43,0:50:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So my order to you is to kill\Nhis sole follower, Daisuke Jigen.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.44,0:50:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That is the best way to eliminate the\NLupin Empire from the face of the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.11,0:50:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If any of you are captured or killed in the\Nprocess, our organization will hot compensate.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.42,0:50:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.29,0:50:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I pray for your success.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.73,0:50:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This tape will now self-destruct.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.44,0:50:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.05,0:50:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.39,0:51:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.72,0:51:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.02,0:51:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's an eruption!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.70,0:51:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the tape?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.04,0:51:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the tape is useless,\Nyou need to find another way.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.99,0:51:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.22,0:51:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh, who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.63,0:51:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What're you doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.33,0:51:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My wallet and one kiss isn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.36,0:51:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You saying I stole your wallet?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.73,0:51:49.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I already got it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.17,0:51:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,And this too. It was easier than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.21,0:51:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.91,0:52:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what you want,\NI can be even more perverse.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.35,0:52:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.22,0:52:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, that felt good.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.69,0:52:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? I feel unusually calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.47,0:52:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.43,0:52:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,she got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.17,0:52:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, what a fix I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.54,0:53:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who're you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.78,0:53:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,An assassin.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.35,0:53:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You startled me. Who sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.75,0:53:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.59,0:53:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the Assassin's Code?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.85,0:53:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.\NIs that the Assassin's Code?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.72,0:53:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.62,0:53:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.40,0:53:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.24,0:53:35.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.28,0:53:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's review it in slow motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.42,0:53:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You still didn't take it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.10,0:53:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.60,0:54:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I got rid of 'em, I got rid of 'em, I got rid of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.05,0:54:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.18,0:54:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.55,0:54:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lupin, you must stop doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.79,0:54:29.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, stop it. No, you mustn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.56,0:54:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh dear, mmmmm,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.54,0:54:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Lupin, don't come any closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.21,0:54:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's happening? Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.98,0:54:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.92,0:54:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oh not{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.16,0:54:59.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.09,0:55:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.10,0:55:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,In accordance with\NCriminal Law, article 175...CUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.07,0:55:10.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop fooling around.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.40,0:55:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.17,0:55:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,For the same reason... CUT!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.31,0:55:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he, again!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.85,0:55:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.02,0:55:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, so he's come out. Goood.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.06,0:55:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.56,0:55:36.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, something's come flying. Oops,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.20,0:55:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,he he he, you suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.73,0:55:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.35,0:55:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.18,0:56:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,you jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.05,0:56:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.38,0:56:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm mm...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.86,0:56:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,All these nuns are too pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.33,0:56:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.20,0:56:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaat?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.90,0:56:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.58,0:57:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's up to the man
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.21,0:57:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,To take his chance at love.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.45,0:57:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Da-da-da-da-dal
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.89,0:57:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Bitter cigarettes bring on the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.33,0:57:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Passionate words bring on the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.76,0:57:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a woman's man. You're a woman's man.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.10,0:57:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,We want you to\Nroughly take charge of our hearts...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.29,0:57:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.54,0:58:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn pussy-cats! Comel!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.55,0:58:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Smooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.51,0:58:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Tickle, tickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.27,0:58:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eeeecew! Noooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.28,0:58:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the, what the? What the hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.68,0:58:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy was found at the wharf\Nlast night with a blow to his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.02,0:58:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And the two who dropped in the woods by the\Nmansion. Both of these look like Lupin's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.36,0:58:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I KNOW he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.86,0:58:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.49,0:58:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't really have any proof Lupin did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.80,0:59:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If nothing else, we know he did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.30,0:59:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirl
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.97,0:59:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We found another one by the bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.31,0:59:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lupin! It's gotta be Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.84,0:59:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.11,0:59:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirl
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.15,0:59:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,There's just been an earthquake in 1zu!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.35,0:59:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Lupin! It must've been Lupin's doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.99,0:59:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirl
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.76,0:59:27.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Our Mike just gave birth to five Kittens!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.76,0:59:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That must also be Lupin's doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.47,0:59:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.57,0:59:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirll
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.31,0:59:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin has just turned himself in!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.64,0:59:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Lupin! That damn Lupin did... WHAT?!!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.05,0:59:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.27,1:00:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,LUPIN!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.54,1:00:17.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, what a drag.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.84,1:00:20.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The world's been so crazy these days,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.28,1:00:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to go to a quiet place to get some\Npeace, and your cell block looked quite appealing,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.92,1:00:25.16,Default,,0,0,0,,so I decided to stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.18,1:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.68,1:00:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you show me to my room?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.35,1:00:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Ummm, did we have one available?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.19,1:00:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't we have one on the far wing open?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.59,1:00:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.86,1:00:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come with us, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.83,1:00:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Step this way, dear patron.\NWell, come with us, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.33,1:00:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Step this way, dear patron.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.80,1:00:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Dinner will be served at seven o'clock, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.03,1:00:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.00,1:00:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.71,1:00:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you call, Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.01,1:00:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.41,1:00:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.68,1:01:00.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin the Third has been arrested!!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.19,1:01:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin turned himself in!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.99,1:01:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Inspector Zenigata gives him a special room.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.00,1:01:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Buon giorno. Good morning,\Nfollowers of the Dark Streets.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.87,1:01:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As you well know, our arch enemy,\NLupin the Third has been arrested,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.98,1:01:31.21,Default,,0,0,0,,and it is apparent that he will be executed soon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.48,1:01:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Since this mission has become meaningless,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.89,1:01:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,be it Miami, Nice, Acapulco, or Southeast\NAsia, you can all take leave wherever you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.66,1:01:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to disobey me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.33,1:01:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, brothers, I would like to draw\Nyour attention to the picture on the wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.37,1:01:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an example of the pottery that was produced\Nat the end of the Jomon Era in northeastern Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.24,1:02:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It is called a "darkened clay figure."
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.41,1:02:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It is also said that these darkened clay figures\Nwere replicas of aliens who landed in the area.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.85,1:02:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,How ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.82,1:02:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't laugh, you fools.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.63,1:02:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The proof lies in the several clay figures that\Nwere discovered disappearing in strange ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.73,1:02:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, in the eyes of the most\Nrecently discovered clay figure,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.34,1:02:32.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It was discovered that there were multi-colored jewels\Nmade of an unknown substance embedded in the eye sockets.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.84,1:02:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's more, the picture can only show\None color, and what's even more intriguing...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.78,1:02:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,...is the fact that the jewels are thought to contain\Npsychokinetic energy we humans have yet to harness.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.92,1:02:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,All the wealthy superstitious people of the\Nworld are scrambling to get a piece of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.53,1:02:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And this brings me to your task. I want you to steal\Nthis clay figure, and sell it to the highest bidder.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.37,1:03:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I call it "Operation Psychokinesis". If any of you are killed or captured\Nduring the mission, the organization will not compensate, so be aware.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.34,1:03:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I pray for your success.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.35,1:03:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This tape will self-destruct in...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.88,1:03:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kidding, no explosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.73,1:03:25.59,Default,,0,0,0,,However, it WILL make a noise.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.40,1:03:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I certainly can't let THIS get away.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.23,1:03:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Good thing it was just a noise. Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.27,1:03:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.37,1:03:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.14,1:03:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.02,1:03:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.02,1:03:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that way!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.70,1:03:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.46,1:03:59.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.23,1:04:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get her!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.67,1:04:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.24,1:04:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice try, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.51,1:04:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.15,1:04:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me out. Hey, let me out, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.52,1:04:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me out. You'll be sorry!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.63,1:04:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,How much longer do\Nyou plan on staying locked up in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.87,1:04:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, Lupin?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.77,1:04:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.88,1:04:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The food stinks here, but it's very relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.79,1:04:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop joking around!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.09,1:05:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Son, what are you going to do\Nabout rebuilding the Lupin Empire?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.00,1:05:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell ya? I don't plan on rebuilding it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.07,1:05:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.31,1:05:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.61,1:05:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor thing. To think your life with Fujiko is over.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.38,1:05:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Hey, what'd you just say?!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.82,1:05:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.39,1:05:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Jigen-san, your hat and beard\Nare so sexy. Please continue.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.37,1:05:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,According from a reliable source.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.34,1:05:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, from a reliable source.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.14,1:05:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Fujiko has been captured\Nby the Maccherone Organization.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.95,1:05:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whaaaat?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.46,1:06:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job guarding him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.59,1:06:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he, oh, our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.30,1:06:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job guarding him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.07,1:06:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he, oh, our pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.21,1:06:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.51,1:06:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.48,1:06:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A lawyer just left here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.78,1:06:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.69,1:06:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,-And then, another lawyer also\Njust left, right? -Yeah he did.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.82,1:06:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, looking in here, I see Lupin is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.99,1:06:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.97,1:06:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You let Lupin get away?!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.40,1:06:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.44,1:06:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.58,1:07:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,-I'll kill you, I'll kill you,\NI'll kill you! -Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.85,1:07:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.95,1:07:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd he go? Let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.35,1:07:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stinky.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.12,1:07:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.46,1:07:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiots!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.42,1:07:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, that hurt, that hurt!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.60,1:07:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Mr. Zenigata! -General!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.90,1:07:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, it's no use.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.47,1:07:31.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing around! Come here!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.92,1:07:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This capsule is capable of tolerance to large explosions\Nand shocks, making the clay figure inside indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.19,1:07:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.26,1:07:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.70,1:07:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,So then, Inspector Zenigata.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.94,1:08:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I cannot apologize enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.67,1:08:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Zenigata, in penance for my sins,\Nam willing to shatter my bones to...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.98,1:08:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.48,1:08:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Er, yes, what I mean is that\Nyou may punish me as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.65,1:08:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence! I'm giving you orders for Operation P!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.62,1:08:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Operation P?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.02,1:08:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that, Sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.86,1:08:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a mission to move this, the clay figure with psychokinetic\Npowers, to the nation's top science facility for protection.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.97,1:08:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's called "Operation P" for short. That is all.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.40,1:08:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So you were\Nappointed the leader of that mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.11,1:08:38.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.88,1:08:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.78,1:08:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.28,1:08:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.25,1:08:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Future General Superintendent!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.62,1:08:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't go that far.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.25,1:08:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Official announcement. -Here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.72,1:08:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Suddenly cancel led.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.60,1:09:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm speaking from Point A,\NPoint A. Our target has just left.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.41,1:09:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.48,1:09:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.50,1:09:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.28,1:09:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.05,1:09:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi. Do you know where my Fujiko-chan is?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.46,1:10:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Oh?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.36,1:10:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit!!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.37,1:10:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Fujiko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.34,1:10:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.98,1:10:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.98,1:10:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.29,1:10:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What about?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.66,1:10:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oops, I don't have time to play.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.17,1:10:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.57,1:10:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Bastard.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.09,1:11:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, how nostalgic, Fujiko's smell.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.20,1:11:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where did you put Fujiko?\NWhere did you put my girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.78,1:11:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.32,1:11:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy? There is a very\Nexpensive national treasure in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.93,1:11:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, Fujiko is the ultimate national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.17,1:11:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheesh, here he goes again.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.77,1:11:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.30,1:11:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.27,1:11:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, a mysterious helicopter.\NIt must be that jackass, Lupin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.54,1:12:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Heyyyy, what is it? Move the boulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.72,1:12:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohhhh, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.89,1:12:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Have we begun to revamp our waterways?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.26,1:12:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Or is Japan beginning to sink?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.19,1:12:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop talking rubbish and move the boulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.43,1:12:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}'Sirt Go!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.63,1:12:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.36,1:12:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.97,1:12:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.27,1:12:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.37,1:12:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're doing very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.77,1:12:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Umph.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.51,1:12:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme a fist.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.98,1:12:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.41,1:12:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.58,1:12:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiots!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.18,1:12:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.35,1:12:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ultra powerful Offensive Organization speaking.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.73,1:12:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Officers, resistance is futile. Hand\Nyourselves over in peace, or we will kill you all.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.37,1:12:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What?! Get him!!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.44,1:12:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Get him!!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.57,1:13:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't throw away your life like that, Zenigata.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.95,1:13:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit. You think you can just steal the show?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:11.42,1:13:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Does he know him?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.64,1:13:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.07,1:13:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me.\NI'll get'cha out of there right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.64,1:13:39.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.56,1:13:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell? An earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.17,1:14:03.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, ah, there he is! Bastard!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.30,1:14:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.28,1:14:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, you asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.46,1:14:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This should do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.43,1:14:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.10,1:14:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the love scene for later. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.61,1:14:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhhh, the sea, the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.61,1:14:51.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the love scene for later, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.66,1:15:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.70,1:15:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, stupid mobsters. I'll\Nnever give them the capsule.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.07,1:15:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.71,1:15:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.84,1:15:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you can't take that!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.88,1:15:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Stop, thief! Shoot him!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.92,1:15:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.96,1:15:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.83,1:15:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Charge now!!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.53,1:15:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.43,1:15:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, we're charging now. Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.90,1:15:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah. Charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.11,1:15:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Okaaaay. Banzail!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.25,1:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We did it! Haha! Kiss my ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.18,1:15:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.95,1:16:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Wowww, I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.32,1:16:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wowww, I'm impressed!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.09,1:16:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This should work.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.73,1:16:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll escape through that window.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.19,1:16:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute. Before that, Fujiko.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.53,1:16:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't we saving that for later?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.97,1:16:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There might not be a later.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.01,1:16:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.98,1:16:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ignore it, ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.72,1:16:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fujiko.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.95,1:16:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.99,1:16:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Heyyy, where're you going? Stop playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.83,1:16:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It is a bit strange. I wonder what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.10,1:16:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.41,1:16:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, I think something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.88,1:17:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo, just ignore it. No matter what happens,\NI'd gladly go to the bottom layer of Hell for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.83,1:17:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.71,1:17:32.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry, grab on!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.69,1:17:45.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.63,1:17:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We can make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.73,1:17:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be falling off the cliff.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.03,1:17:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Let's go while we can.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.31,1:18:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Ahhh, help melt!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.09,1:18:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure take your pants off a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.50,1:18:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot! It's not like I want to take them off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.13,1:18:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I can't go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.84,1:18:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, help meee.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.31,1:18:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.81,1:18:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, hang in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.88,1:18:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Heeeey, Jigen.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.19,1:18:51.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do something, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.96,1:19:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, I love you. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.00,1:19:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, I wish you would've told me that sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.94,1:19:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.71,1:19:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, I wonder if the\Ngasoline tank was just punctured.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.36,1:19:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, we're saved. Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.06,1:19:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.56,1:19:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.70,1:19:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wonder where we are?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.50,1:19:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you, Arséne Lupin the Third.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.38,1:19:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't you going to give that to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.24,1:19:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not. If it weren't for Lupin and Jigen,\Nthe national treasure would have been taken overseas.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.48,1:19:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very sorry, Sir. But seeing as how\NLupin is a major criminal, I thought...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.22,1:19:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no evidence of that!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.49,1:19:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but he has killed countless men.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.02,1:20:02.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Your proof? If he did, it was in self-defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.23,1:20:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He tried to steal expensive jewels!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.66,1:20:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no solid evidence!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.56,1:20:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I have withesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.46,1:20:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.00,1:20:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.76,1:20:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not trustworthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.50,1:20:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, you let the mob bosses escape.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.37,1:20:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I wouldn't have,\Nbut Lupin used unfair tactics to...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.34,1:20:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Nevertheless, the only evidence I have is that\NLupin the Third protected our national treasure.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.48,1:20:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Your next mission is to locate him and give\Nhim this official thank you. Understand?!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.38,1:20:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.72,1:20:27.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-Don't "Yeah" me!\N-Yes, sirrrrr. -Too long! -Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.06,1:20:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,At the rate things are going, I\Ndon't see a Lupin Empire at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.56,1:20:43.43,Default,,0,0,0,,More like a Lupin retirement home.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.67,1:20:44.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.84,1:20:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.47,1:20:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,At last I have found you. Owww!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.28,1:20:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here he comes again.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.55,1:20:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Lupin!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.35,1:21:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, don't go!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.76,1:21:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop playing around!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.93,1:21:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you want your official thank you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.90,1:21:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll arrest you otherwise!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.40,1:21:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm telling you to stop!!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.71,1:21:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahhh, I've run quite a ways. I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.58,1:21:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.51,1:21:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! There he is! Gol
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.75,1:21:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.09,1:21:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just throw this away!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.05,1:21:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Lupin, wait!!!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.19,1:21:49.03,End,,0,0,0,,{\pos(667,154)}THE END
